      "restoredAt": null,
      "sourceFeatureExtractionItemID": null,
      "sourceLink": null,
      "spam": false,
      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "These features will definitely be necessary.\n\nSetting aside for now that ridiculous claim by the dev team that they “set the PerformanceRank limit at 70,000 polygons based on an assumption of 80-player instances”...\n\nAs I mentioned in the DevUpdate comments, what we users want to limit isn’t “VeryPoor avatars themselves,” but rather “VeryPoor avatars with extremely large uncompressed or download sizes.”",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
    },
    {
      "_id": "69daaf5f84b602ad39a1e627",
      "aiGenerated": false,
      "author": {
        "_id": "58f0f87cae407f11b533b0b2",
